WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.930
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:06.770
Dr. Bright! Don't bring&nbsp;
SCP-682 into the Living Room!

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:10.310
Listen. Jack. Can we talk?&nbsp;
Person to person? Researcher&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:14.390
to researcher's consciousness trapped in&nbsp;
an anomalous amulet? Do not, I repeat,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.390 --> 00:00:22.010
DO NOT, attempt to bring SCP-682 into&nbsp;
SCP-002 "just to see what will happen."

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:26.510
It is not recommended. Don't even&nbsp;
think about it. You hear me? I can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.510 --> 00:00:28.970
tell you're thinking about it, just stop! Stop it!

